# Wine 11.21 memory patches for Chromium-based apps (ima.copilot, CEF, Electron).
#
# Parts 1-2 are ports of John Goodman's prototype patches from
#   https://bugs.winehq.org/show_bug.cgi?id=58805  (attachments 82486, 82487)
# rebased onto wine-11.21 (virtual_init now calloc()s the vprot directory).
# Part 3 (create_temp_file on_disk) is ours: the shared image copies go to a
# disk-backed temp file instead of memfd, so the pages are reclaimable page cache.
#
# Effect on ima.copilot 2.6.16 (Chromium 150): renderers 640-1000 MB -> 40-90 MB.
# Not upstream. LGPL-2.1-or-later like Wine itself.
